_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":549368890,"text":"軟禁じゃんか！で、あっさり買収されたのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[761180114]},{"nodeId":761180114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":614289106,"text":"面白そうな本とかおもちゃも貰った…","nextNodeIds":[761180115]},{"nodeId":761180115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1958022634,"text":"子供に留守番させようとするお母さんみたいだな…","nextNodeIds":[761180116]},{"nodeId":761180116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":261304018,"text":"理由は言ってなかったの？","nextNodeIds":[761180117]},{"nodeId":761180117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":991921698,"text":"ううん、しばらく外に出ないようにってだけ。特に霜月の子には絶対に近づくなって。","nextNodeIds":[761180118]},{"nodeId":761180118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":128775218,"text":"食べ物を届けてくれた動物たちも、ラウマの指示なのか一切口を割らなかったよ。","nextNodeIds":[761180119]},{"nodeId":761180119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1247511682,"text":"えっ…","nextNodeIds":[761180120]},{"nodeId":761180120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1587551282,"text":"あくまで推測だけど…私に関係する何かを準備してるのかも。","nextNodeIds":[761180121]},{"nodeId":761180121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3964545578,"text":"大丈夫だよ。ここにいるのは嫌じゃないし、美味しいものもたくさん食べられる。外に出られないのは全然苦じゃないよ。","nextNodeIds":[761180122]},{"nodeId":761180122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":933950674,"text":"それに、もし霜月の子で本当に何か準備してるなら、好奇心を満たすためだけに邪魔するわけにもいかないでしょ？","nextNodeIds":[761180123]},{"nodeId":761180123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1457786506,"text":"ちょっと聞いてこようか？","nextNodeIds":[761180124]},{"nodeId":761180124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1785495282,"text":"オイラもすごく気にな